                'What makes the specification worth reading is how current it is. Gatehouse names the industry priorities it expects learners to engage with by name: building safety, information management, whole-life value, sustainability, supply chain complexity, and shifting regulatory and commercial practice. This is also the only qualification in its Level 7 range for which the awarding body publishes specific target job titles.',
